NOTE / 附加说明

The decompiled sources under src/WeComSever/ and the native binaries under
native/bin/ and dist/ originate from the closed-source program "微灵"
(WeComSever) by its original author. They are included here for research and
interoperability purposes only. Copyright in those parts remains with the
original author. If the original author objects to this repository, the
maintainers will remove the affected files upon request.

